<title>USA: MBIA announces secondary market insurance.</title>
<headline>MBIA announces secondary market insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp. has limited capacity in the following names on a first-come first-served basis.</p>
<p>Local Government Assistance Corp (LGAC)</p>
<p>Puerto Rico Highways</p>
<p>New York City GOs</p>
<p>Port Everglades, Fla.,</p>
<p>Puerto Rico EPAs</p>
<p>Grand River Dam Authority</p>
<p>Please call 1-800-MBIA-NOW for lastest prices.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
